        "body": "This sentence mixes a statement (\"Interactive sign-in offers this setup in a prompt\") with an imperative clause (\"or use the flag when no prompt is available\") joined by `or`, which reads as a grammar mismatch. Consider splitting into two sentences, e.g. \"Interactive sign-in offers this setup in a prompt. Use the flag instead when no prompt is available, such as in a CI/CD job.\""
      },
